OL,3,GNEWSANHS leaders say maternity care
OL,4,Aorganisation is 'not fit for purpose'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS bosses in England say the way
OL,7,Fmaternity care is organised is "not fit
OL,8,Ffor purpose" with safety at risk and
OL,9,Fwarn some smaller units may have to
OL,10,Fclose.
OL,12,FThe NHS Alliance, which represents
OL,13,Fhealth managers, warn difficult
OL,14,Fdecisions lie ahead and maternity
OL,15,Fservices need to be consolidated to
OL,16,Fsupport safer care.
OL,18,FIt said a government taskforce into
OL,19,Fneonatal and maternity care must tackle
OL,20,Fkey issues such as a lack of specialist
OL,21,Fstaff and a rise in C-sections.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
